       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "text": "Graphic Design FAQs",
       "align": "center",
       "classes": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "What graphic design services do you offer in Austin?",
       "a": "<p>We design business cards, flyers, postcards, brochures, banners, yard signs, menus, labels, packaging, apparel graphics and social media images for Austin businesses.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How fast can I get a flyer or business card designed?",
       "a": "<p>Same-day turnaround is often possible for straightforward pieces after review. Larger projects such as brochures or packaging take longer, and your designer will confirm timing before starting.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do I have to pay before you start?",
       "a": "<p>No. There is no upfront payment. You review the design, request changes and pay once you approve it.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Will the files work with my print shop?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We provide print-ready PDFs with correct bleed, CMYK color and outlined fonts, plus PNG or JPG files for web and social use. If your printer has specific requirements, just send them to us.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can you use my existing logo and brand colors?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We design around your current logo, colors and fonts. If your logo file is low resolution or made with AI, we can rebuild it as a vector first.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do you design t-shirts and apparel graphics?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. We create shirt and merchandise graphics prepared for screen printing, DTG or embroidery, with the color separations your vendor needs.</p>"
      }
     ],
     "classes": []
    }
   ]
  },
